<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<title>票上写 8 排 5 号，数对为什么写 (5, 8)？</title>
<style>
/* ===== 配色方案：从 references/color-schemes.md 选一个 :root 块 ===== */
:root {
  --primary: #283593; --primary-light: #3F51B5;
  --accent: #26C6DA; --accent-soft: #B2EBF2;
  --ink: #141B41; --paper: #F6F7FC; --paper-2: #E8EAF6;
  --line: #CFD3E8; --green: #2E7D32; --red: #C62828;
  --shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(40,53,147,.16);
}

/* ===== 课件配置块（所有常量集中声明） ===== */
/* IMG_PREFIX: 图片路径前缀，统一为 'img/'（图片放 deploy/img/ 子目录，部署后 URL 为 img/xxx.jpg） */
/* 不在 CSS 中声明，在 JS 中用 var IMG_PREFIX = 'img/'; */

/* ===== 基础样式 ===== */
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{overflow:hidden;height:100%}
body{
  font-family:"Noto Serif SC","Songti SC","Microsoft YaHei",serif;
  background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);
  height:100dvh;overflow:hidden;position:relative;
  font-size:21px;line-height:1.65;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;
}

/* ===== 导航条 ===== */
nav#topNav{
  position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:200;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--primary-light));
  padding:6px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  flex-wrap:nowrap;overflow-x:auto;
  box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
  -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;
}
nav#topNav::-webkit-scrollbar{height:3px}
nav#topNav::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);border-radius:2px}
nav#topNav .chip{
  flex-shrink:0;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);
  font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .25s;
  white-space:nowrap;border:1px solid transparent;font-weight:500;
}
nav#topNav .chip:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.25)}
nav#topNav .chip.active{
  background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-weight:700;
  border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(255,143,0,.4);
}
/* 导航芯片类型样式 */
nav#topNav .chip.pre{background:rgba(255,143,0,.25);color:#fff}
nav#topNav .chip.mid{background:rgba(0,137,123,.25);color:#fff}
nav#topNav .chip.post{background:rgba(211,47,47,.25);color:#fff}
nav#topNav .chip.sim{background:rgba(21,101,192,.25);color:#fff}
nav#topNav .chip-end{background:rgba(255,255,255,.25);color:#fff}

/* ===== 进度条 ===== */
#progressWrap{
  position:fixed;top:44px;left:0;right:0;height:4px;z-index:201;
  background:rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}
#progressBar{
  height:100%;background:var(--accent);
  width:0%;transition:width .4s ease;border-radius:0 2px 2px 0;
}

/* ===== 翻页容器 ===== */
#pageContainer{flex:1;position:relative;overflow:hidden;margin-top:48px}

/* ===== 页面通用 ===== */
.page{
  position:absolute;inset:0;overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:hidden;
  display:none;padding:32px 36px 40px;
  animation:fadeSlide .4s ease;
}
.page.active{display:block}
@keyframes fadeSlide{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.page::-webkit-scrollbar{width:5px}
.page::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--line);border-radius:3px}

/* ===== 全屏按钮：v2026-09-28e 定案「默认不放」 =====
   资料库外壳 sandbox 无 allow-fullscreen，网页代码达不到 F11 式真全屏；
   故骨架不放全屏按钮（HTML/CSS/JS 三件套一律不配）。
   课堂需要全屏时：引导用户直接按键盘 F11，或下载 HTML 直开。
   确需按钮的特殊场景 → 从 teaching-control.js 取三级降级实现（见 SKILL.md §3.6③）。 */

/* ===== 翻页按钮 ===== */
/* ⚠ !important 加固（v2026-09-29）：页码与翻页键必须恒在底部居中——
   实测部分课件会被其它 fixed/absolute 样式挤到左侧，全部属性加 !important 防挤占。 */
/* ⚠ z-index 500 顶层（v2026-10-13；v1.7.0 改两段式）：页码指示器是教师端入口第一击（1.5s 双击武装 + 点封面徽章），
   必须恒在页面内容/通信状态/揭示遮罩之上可点击。预留层级表见 workflow-dev.md §3.6④——
   页面内容元素 z-index 一律 ≤99，禁止与导航层（500）争层级。 */
#navBtns{
  position:fixed !important;bottom:20px !important;left:50% !important;
  right:auto !important;top:auto !important;transform:translateX(-50%) !important;
  display:flex !important;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;z-index:500;
}
#navBtns button{
  width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--primary);
  background:var(--paper);color:var(--primary);font-size:22px;
  cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  transition:all .2s;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
#navBtns button:hover{background:var(--primary);color:#fff}
#navBtns button:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:default}
#navBtns button:disabled:hover{background:var(--paper);color:var(--primary)}
#pageIndicator{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--primary);min-width:80px;text-align:center}

/* ===== 封面页 =====
   注意：display:flex 必须写为 .page.active .cover-page（级联选择器，特异性 0,3,0），
   绝不能写 .cover-page.active、也绝不能裸写 .cover-page{display:flex}！
   原因：翻页系统 showPage() 只给 <section class="page"> 加/减 active 类，
   嵌套的 .cover-page div 永远没有 active 类 → .cover-page.active 永不匹配；
   裸写 .cover-page{display:flex} 则同特异性(0,1,0)下源码靠后覆盖 .page{display:none}，
   导致封面翻走后仍渲染（《价格理论》翻走后不消失、《氓》浅黄底+白字均源于此坑）。
   另：本规则必须自带深色 background 衬托白字 —— 否则白字落在浅色 --paper 上＝整页白底白字
   （《基尔霍夫定律》封面即此坑：技能内 page-templates.html 用内联渐变、而本骨架曾缺失，
   两份模板不一致；现已统一由本 CSS 提供默认深色底，任何配色下白字都有对比度）。 */
.page.active .cover-page{
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;
  width:100%;height:100%;color:#fff;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,0,0,.15),rgba(0,0,0,.35)),linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--primary-light));
}
#p0{padding:0;overflow:hidden}
.cover-page h1{font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;margin-bottom:12px;text-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.cover-page .sub{font-size:24px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);margin-bottom:32px}
.cover-page .tags{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:36px}
.cover-page .tag{padding:8px 20px;border-radius:24px;background:rgba(255,143,0,.7);color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:600}
.cover-page .hint{margin-top:40px;font-size:18px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7)}

/* ===== 讲授页 ===== */
.teach-title{font-size:34px;font-weight:900;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:24px;border-bottom:3px solid var(--accent);padding-bottom:10px}
.teach-text{font-size:21px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:20px}
.teach-text strong{color:var(--accent)}
.key-box{
  background:var(--paper-2);border-left:5px solid var(--accent);
  padding:16px 20px;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;margin:16px 0;font-size:20px;
}
.key-box strong{color:var(--primary)}
.feature-list{list-style:none;padding:0}
.feature-list li{padding:10px 0 10px 32px;position:relative;font-size:20px;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)}
.feature-list li::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:4px;top:16px;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)}
.card-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin:16px 0}
.card{background:var(--paper-2);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);transition:all .25s}
.card:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.card h4{color:var(--primary);font-size:22px;margin-bottom:10px}
.card p{font-size:19px;line-height:1.7}
.highlight-num{
  display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;
  width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;text-align:center;
  line-height:32px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin-right:8px;
}

/* ===== 仿真页 ===== */
.sim-page{padding:24px 20px 40px}
.sim-title{font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:12px;text-align:center}
.sim-desc{text-align:center;font-size:19px;color:var(--primary-light);margin-bottom:20px}
.sim-controls{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px}
.sim-controls label{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;color:var(--primary)}
.sim-controls input[type="range"]{width:200px;accent-color:var(--accent)}
.sim-controls input[type="range"]:focus{outline:none}
.sim-controls .val-display{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);min-width:80px;text-align:center}
.sim-canvas-wrap{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px}
.canvas-box{text-align:center}
.canvas-box canvas{border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;max-width:100%;height:auto}
.canvas-box .cap{font-size:18px;color:var(--primary);margin-top:6px;font-weight:600}

/* ===== 测验页 ===== */
.quiz-page{padding:28px 36px 48px}
.quiz-title{font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:20px;text-align:center}
.quiz-hint{font-size:18px;color:var(--primary-light);text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px}
.quiz-q{
  background:var(--paper-2);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 24px;
  margin-bottom:16px;border:2px solid var(--line);transition:border-color .3s;
}
.quiz-q.answered{border-color:var(--primary-light)}
.quiz-q .q-stem{font-size:21px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:14px}
.quiz-q .opts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.quiz-q .opt{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 16px;
  border-radius:10px;border:2px solid var(--line);cursor:pointer;
  transition:all .2s;font-size:20px;
}
.quiz-q .opt:hover{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-soft)}
.quiz-q .opt.selected{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-soft)}
.quiz-q .opt .badge{
  width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--primary-light);
  color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-weight:700;font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0;
}
.quiz-q .opt.correct{border-color:var(--green);background:#e0f2f1}
.quiz-q .opt.correct .badge{background:var(--green)}
.quiz-q .opt.wrong{border-color:var(--red);background:#fbe9e7}
.quiz-q .opt.wrong .badge{background:var(--red)}
/* ⚠ v2026-09-29 定案「提交前可随时修改」：选项锁定挂 .submitted 前缀（submitQuiz 时加），
   .answered 只表示已作答、不锁——学生提交前可随时改选/重确认。禁止改回 .answered 前缀锁定。 */
.quiz-q.submitted .opt{pointer-events:none;opacity:.85}
.quiz-q.submitted .opt.correct{opacity:1}
.feedback{margin-top:12px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:8px;font-size:19px;display:none;line-height:1.7}
.feedback.show{display:block;animation:fadeSlide .25s}
.feedback.correct-fb{background:#e0f2f1;border:1px solid var(--green);color:#004d40}
.feedback.wrong-fb{background:#fbe9e7;border:1px solid var(--red);color:#4e1a06}
.feedback .fb-icon{margin-right:8px;font-weight:700}
.quiz-actions{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-top:28px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.quiz-actions button{padding:12px 32px;border-radius:30px;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;border:2px solid var(--accent);transition:all .2s}
.btn-submit{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)!important}
.btn-submit:hover{background:#e67e00;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(255,143,0,.3)}
.btn-submit:disabled{background:#ccc;color:#999;border-color:#ccc!important;cursor:not-allowed;box-shadow:none}
.btn-retry{background:var(--paper);color:var(--primary)}
.btn-retry:hover{background:var(--paper-2)}
.quiz-score{text-align:center;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:var(--green);margin-top:20px;display:none}

/* ===== 总结页 ===== */
.summary-page{padding:28px 36px 48px}
.summary-title{font-size:34px;font-weight:900;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:24px;text-align:center}
.summary-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
.summary-item{background:var(--paper-2);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;border-left:5px solid var(--accent)}
.summary-item h4{font-size:22px;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:8px}
.summary-item p{font-size:19px;line-height:1.7}
.mantra{text-align:center;font-size:28px;font-weight:900;color:var(--accent);margin:24px 0;padding:20px;background:var(--paper-2);border-radius:14px}
.score-compare{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:32px;margin:24px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}
.score-compare .sc{text-align:center;padding:20px 28px;background:var(--paper-2);border-radius:14px;min-width:140px}
.score-compare .sc .label{font-size:20px;color:var(--primary-light);margin-bottom:4px}
.score-compare .sc .val{font-size:36px;font-weight:900;color:var(--primary)}
.score-compare .sc .val.green{color:var(--green)}
.score-compare .arrow{font-size:40px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:900}

/* ===== 知识结构图（HTML可折叠树） ===== */
.mindmap .node{cursor:pointer;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);margin:4px 0;background:var(--paper-2)}
.mindmap .branch{margin-left:24px}
.mindmap .branch.collapsed{display:none}
.mindmap .icon{margin-right:8px}
.mindmap .brief{display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--primary-light);margin-top:4px}

/* ===== 响应式 ===== */
@media(max-width:768px){
  .page{padding:20px 16px 56px}
  .cover-page h1{font-size:32px}
  .cover-page .sub{font-size:20px}
  .teach-title{font-size:28px}
  .teach-text{font-size:20px}
  .card-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .sim-canvas-wrap{flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
  .sim-controls input[type="range"]{width:140px}
  nav#topNav{padding:4px 8px;gap:6px}
  nav#topNav .chip{padding:4px 10px;font-size:14px}
  #navBtns button{width:40px;height:40px;font-size:18px}
  /* v2026-10-13：收窄页码防 320px 窄屏与右下二维码徽章相碰；揭示提示条上移，
     为通信状态条（step4 注入，移动端 bottom:84px）让位 */
  #pageIndicator{min-width:56px;font-size:18px}
  #revealHint{bottom:124px}
  .quiz-q{padding:16px}
  .quiz-q .q-stem{font-size:20px}
  .quiz-q .opt{font-size:19px;padding:10px 12px}
  .summary-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .score-compare{gap:16px}
  .score-compare .sc{padding:14px 20px}
  .score-compare .sc .val{font-size:28px}
}

/* ===== 图文混排（有图有文页面必用，禁止把图堆到页面底部） ===== */
/* ⚠ v1.5.5 图文层叠铁律：图片恒在文字之上（含「图片先揭示、文字后揭示」）
   —— 浮动图用 float 时是脱离文档流的，后续文字块一旦因 transform（reveal 动画）
   或 position:relative 形成层叠上下文，就会整块画在图上，把图压住（文字背景条尤其明显）。
   因此 .fig / .reveal-img-group / .page-img 一律 position:relative + z-index:2，
   而页面内文字块（含背景条）层级不得 ≥2。 */
.clearfix::after{content:'';display:block;clear:both}
.fig{text-align:center;margin:8px 0;position:relative;z-index:2}
.fig img{width:100%;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.fig .caption{font-size:16px;color:var(--primary-light);margin-top:4px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5}
.fig.float-r{float:right;width:44%;margin-left:24px;margin-bottom:12px}
.fig.float-l{float:left;width:42%;margin-right:24px;margin-bottom:12px}
@media(max-width:768px){
  .fig.float-r,.fig.float-l{float:none;width:100%;margin:12px 0}
}
/* 图文组（img + caption 作为一步揭示）：整组同样压住文字块 */
.reveal-img-group{position:relative;z-index:2;isolation:isolate}
.reveal-img-group img{width:100%;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.page-img{display:block;margin:20px auto;max-width:92%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);border:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;z-index:2}
.img-caption{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--primary-light);margin-top:6px;font-weight:600}

/* ===== 全局滚动条 ===== */
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:5px;height:5px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--line);border-radius:3px}

/* ===== 渐进呈现动画系统（24种） ===== */
/* 基础隐藏状态 */
.reveal-hidden{opacity:0;visibility:hidden;pointer-events:none}
.reveal-hidden.reveal-done{animation-fill-mode:forwards;visibility:visible;opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
/* 揭示进度指示器 */
#revealHint{
  position:fixed;bottom:80px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:140;
  display:none;align-items:center;gap:8px;
  background:rgba(200,16,46,.12);color:var(--primary);padding:6px 16px;
  border-radius:20px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;
  pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .3s;
}
#revealHint .r-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)}
#revealHint .r-progress{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}

/* A1: 淡入上浮 */
.reveal-fade-up{animation:fadeUp .5s cubic-bezier(.25,.46,.45,.94) both}
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
/* A2: 打字机 — JS实现，此处仅光标样式 */
.reveal-typewriter .tw-cursor{border-right:2px solid var(--accent);animation:blink .8s infinite}
@keyframes blink{50%{border-color:transparent}}
/* A3: 段落逐现 — 配合 animation-delay */
.reveal-fade-up-seq{animation:fadeUp .5s cubic-bezier(.25,.46,.45,.94) both}
/* A4: 模糊聚焦 */
.reveal-blur-focus{animation:blurFocus .6s ease both}
@keyframes blurFocus{from{opacity:0;filter:blur(8px)}to{opacity:1;filter:blur(0)}}
/* A5: 高亮脉冲 */
.reveal-pulse{animation:highlightPulse .8s ease both}
@keyframes highlightPulse{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 var(--accent-soft)}50%{box-shadow:0 0 16px 8px var(--accent-soft)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 var(--accent-soft)}}
/* A6: 字幕展开 */
.reveal-slide-x{animation:slideX .5s cubic-bezier(.25,.46,.45,.94) both}
@keyframes slideX{from{opacity:0;transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left}to{opacity:1;transform:scaleX(1)}}

/* B1: 列表逐条滑入 */
.reveal-li-slide{animation:liSlide .45s cubic-bezier(.25,.46,.45,.94) both}
@keyframes liSlide{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0)}}
/* B2: 编号步骤 — 圆圈弹入 */
.reveal-step-num .highlight-num{animation:popIn .45s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) both}
@keyframes popIn{from{transform:scale(0)}60%{transform:scale(1.2)}to{transform:scale(1)}}
.reveal-step-num.reveal-hidden .highlight-num{transform:scale(0)}
/* F1: 勾选清单（编号与 SKILL.md 动画目录一致） */
.reveal-check{animation:checkReveal .5s ease both}
@keyframes checkReveal{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0)}}
/* F2: 层级缩进展开（编号与 SKILL.md 动画目录一致） */
.reveal-indent{animation:indentExpand .45s ease both;overflow:hidden}
@keyframes indentExpand{from{opacity:0;max-height:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0}to{opacity:1;max-height:200px}}

/* C1: 帷幕揭图 */
.reveal-curtain{position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.reveal-curtain img{display:block}
.reveal-curtain::before,.reveal-curtain::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;width:50%;height:100%;z-index:2;transition:transform .7s cubic-bezier(.7,0,.3,1)}
.reveal-curtain::before{left:0;background:var(--primary)}
.reveal-curtain::after{right:0;background:var(--primary)}
.reveal-curtain.reveal-hidden::before{transform:translateX(0)}
.reveal-curtain.reveal-hidden::after{transform:translateX(0)}
.reveal-curtain.reveal-done::before{transform:translateX(-100%)}
.reveal-curtain.reveal-done::after{transform:translateX(100%)}
/* C2: 底片显影 */
.reveal-sepia{animation:sepiaDevelop 1s ease both}
@keyframes sepiaDevelop{from{filter:sepia(1) brightness(.3)}to{filter:sepia(0) brightness(1)}}
/* C3: 框入聚焦 */
.reveal-focus-in{animation:focusIn .55s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) both}
@keyframes focusIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.85)}60%{transform:scale(1.03)}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}}
/* C4: 浮动入位 — 右浮图片专用 */
.reveal-float-in-r{animation:floatInR .5s cubic-bezier(.25,.46,.45,.94) both}
@keyframes floatInR{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(60px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0)}}
.reveal-float-in-l{animation:floatInL .5s cubic-bezier(.25,.46,.45,.94) both}
@keyframes floatInL{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-60px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0)}}
/* C5: Ken Burns 慢移（持续） */
.reveal-kenburns img{animation:kenBurns 8s ease alternate infinite}
@keyframes kenBurns{from{transform:scale(1)}to{transform:scale(1.08) translate(-2%,-1%)}}

/* F3: 卡片翻转（编号与 SKILL.md 动画目录一致） */
.reveal-flip-card{perspective:800px}
.reveal-flip-card .flip-inner{transition:transform .6s;transform-style:preserve-3d}
.reveal-flip-card.reveal-done .flip-inner{transform:rotateY(180deg)}
.reveal-flip-card .flip-front,.reveal-flip-card .flip-back{backface-visibility:hidden;position:absolute;inset:0}
.reveal-flip-card .flip-back{transform:rotateY(180deg)}
/* D2: 卡片弹入 */
.reveal-card-pop{animation:cardPop .55s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) both}
@keyframes cardPop{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.7)}60%{transform:scale(1.06)}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}}
/* D3: 网格填充 — 配合 animation-delay */
.reveal-card-grid .card{animation:cardPop .55s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) both}
.reveal-card-grid.reveal-hidden .card{opacity:0;animation:none}
/* D4: 折叠展开 */
.reveal-fold{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .5s cubic-bezier(.25,.46,.45,.94)}
.reveal-fold.reveal-done{max-height:600px}

/* E1: 关键框滑入 */
.reveal-slide-left{animation:slideLeft .5s cubic-bezier(.25,.46,.45,.94) both}
@keyframes slideLeft{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-60px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0)}}
.reveal-slide-right{animation:slideRight .5s cubic-bezier(.25,.46,.45,.94) both}
@keyframes slideRight{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(60px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0)}}
/* E2: 引用金句 */
.reveal-quote{animation:quoteReveal .6s ease both}
@keyframes quoteReveal{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.9)}40%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1.03)}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}}
/* E3: 表格逐行 */
.reveal-tr-fade{animation:fadeUp .4s cubic-bezier(.25,.46,.45,.94) both}
/* E4: 数字跳动 — JS实现 */
.reveal-count-up{}
/* E5: 聚光灯 */
.reveal-spotlight{position:relative}
.reveal-spotlight::before{content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.55);z-index:300;transition:opacity .4s}
.reveal-spotlight.reveal-done::before{opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
.reveal-spotlight > *{position:relative;z-index:301}

/* ===== 图片全屏灯箱 ===== */
#imgLightbox{
  display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9999;
  background:rgba(0,0,0,.92);justify-content:center;align-items:center;
  cursor:zoom-out;
}
#imgLightbox.show{display:flex}
#imgLightbox img{
  max-width:95vw;max-height:95vh;object-fit:contain;
  border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
  animation:lightboxIn .3s ease;
}
@keyframes lightboxIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.9)}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}}
#imgLightbox .lb-close{
  position:absolute;top:20px;right:24px;width:44px;height:44px;
  border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:#fff;
  font-size:24px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  border:none;transition:background .2s;
}
#imgLightbox .lb-close:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.3)}
/* 图片可点击放大提示 */
.teach-text img, .fig img, .page-img, .card img{cursor:zoom-in;transition:opacity .2s}
.teach-text img:hover, .fig img:hover, .page-img:hover, .card img:hover{opacity:.85}

/* ===== 伪全屏兜底 CSS（第四代标准件 §3）=====
   默认不放「全屏按钮」，但下面三条规则必须保留——
   删了 pagesync-test-mqtt.js 的 S7 直接 FAIL；伪全屏时顶部导航须压课件层之上。 */
body.fs-pseudo #pageContainer{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9999}
body.fs-pseudo #topNav{z-index:10001 !important}
body.fs-pseudo #navBtns, body.fs-pseudo #mqttStatus{z-index:10000 !important}

/* ===== 底部导航胶囊（深色封面上也看得见页码） ===== */
#navBtns{background:rgba(245,248,251,.95);border-radius:34px;padding:5px 10px;box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
#revealHint{bottom:98px}
#matchP3{max-width:780px;margin:0 auto}
.page{padding-bottom:104px}

/* ===== 表格（讲授页对比表） ===== */
.teach-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:18px 0;font-size:19px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.teach-table th{background:var(--primary);color:#fff;padding:12px 14px;text-align:left;font-weight:700;font-size:17px}
.teach-table td{padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.teach-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
.teach-table td:first-child{font-weight:700;color:var(--primary)}

/* ===== 按钮 ===== */
.btn-retry,.btn-primary{padding:9px 24px;border-radius:22px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;border:2px solid var(--primary);background:var(--paper);color:var(--primary);transition:all .2s;margin:6px 4px}
.btn-retry:hover,.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--primary);color:#fff}
.btn-primary:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}

/* ===== 仿真读数 ===== */
.sim-readout{text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--primary);margin:12px 0 4px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.sim-tip{text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var(--primary-light);margin-bottom:10px;min-height:26px}

@media(max-width:768px){.page{padding-bottom:104px}}

/* ===== V4 模块卡片总结页 ===== */
.summary-v4-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(420px,100%),1fr));gap:20px;margin-bottom:20px}
.summary-v4-card{background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;transition:all .35s;cursor:pointer}
.summary-v4-card:hover{border-color:var(--primary);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
.summary-v4-card.expanded{border-color:var(--primary);box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.12);grid-column:span 2}
@media(max-width:700px){.summary-v4-card.expanded{grid-column:auto}}
.summary-v4-header{padding:22px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;background:var(--paper-2);transition:background .3s}
.summary-v4-card.expanded .summary-v4-header{background:var(--paper)}
.summary-v4-num{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--line);color:var(--primary);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px;font-weight:500;flex-shrink:0;transition:all .3s}
.summary-v4-card.expanded .summary-v4-num{background:var(--primary);color:#fff}
.summary-v4-title{font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:var(--primary);flex:1}
.summary-v4-summary{font-size:18px;color:var(--primary-light);line-height:1.5}
.summary-v4-indicator{font-size:18px;color:var(--line);transition:transform .35s;flex-shrink:0}
.summary-v4-card.expanded .summary-v4-indicator{transform:rotate(180deg);color:var(--primary)}
.summary-v4-body{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .5s ease}
.summary-v4-card.expanded .summary-v4-body{max-height:900px}
.summary-v4-inner{padding:0 20px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
.summary-v4-flip{perspective:600px;height:150px;cursor:pointer}
.summary-v4-flip-inner{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;transition:transform .45s;transform-style:preserve-3d}
.summary-v4-flip.flipped .summary-v4-flip-inner{transform:rotateY(180deg)}
.summary-v4-flip-front,.summary-v4-flip-back{position:absolute;width:100%;height:100%;backface-visibility:hidden;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px 18px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.6}
.summary-v4-flip-front{background:var(--accent-soft);border:2px solid var(--accent);color:var(--primary);font-weight:700;text-align:center;flex-direction:column}
.summary-v4-flip-front .fh{font-size:14px;color:var(--primary-light);font-weight:400;margin-top:6px}
.summary-v4-flip-back{background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--primary);color:var(--ink);text-align:left;transform:rotateY(180deg);overflow-y:auto;padding:16px 18px;font-size:17px}
@keyframes popIn{0%{transform:scale(.95);opacity:0}100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1}}
.summary-v4-card.expanded{animation:popIn .3s ease}
.summary-v4-toolbar{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px}
.summary-v4-toolbar button{padding:8px 20px;border-radius:18px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;border:2px solid var(--primary);background:var(--paper);color:var(--primary);transition:all .2s}
.summary-v4-toolbar button:hover{background:var(--primary);color:#fff}

.cover-page .tag{background:rgba(38,198,218,.95);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);color:#102A33}

#p2cards.card-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
#p5cards.card-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
#p2cards .card .eq,#p5cards .card .eq{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}
.card .eq{font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary);margin:8px 0;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-line}

.wrong-num{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--red);margin:4px 0 8px;line-height:1.4}

.sim-readout{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary)}
.sim-log .hl{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}
.btn-primary{background:var(--primary);color:#fff;border:none}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--primary-light)}
.btn-retry{background:var(--paper);color:var(--primary);border:1.5px solid var(--accent)}

#p3fig svg,#p5fig svg,#p2fig svg{max-width:100%;height:auto}

@media (max-width:640px){
  #p2cards.card-grid,#p5cards.card-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .card .eq{font-size:16px}
  .wrong-num{font-size:17px}
  .cover-fig svg{width:100%;height:auto}
}

.sim-status{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.sim-status .sim-readout{flex:1 1 auto}
.sim-status .sim-tip{flex:0 1 auto;text-align:right}

#matchP3 .match-item{padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:9px;font-size:18px}
#matchP3 .match-col h4{margin-bottom:8px}

.sim-controls{flex-wrap:wrap}
.sim-log-line{padding:3px 0;font-size:13px;color:#455A64;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)}

#p6 .feature-list{margin-top:10px}
#p6 .feature-list li{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;margin:6px 0}
#p6 .canvas-box canvas{max-height:300px;width:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto}
#p6 .sim-desc{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:4px auto 8px;max-width:760px}
#p6 .feature-list li{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:4px 0}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ===== 顶部导航 ===== -->
